{"id":850,"name":"EcoFlow DELTA 3 Max Plus \u2013 Station \u00c9lectrique 2 048 Wh \/ 3 000 W","slug":"ecoflow-delta-3-max-plus-station-electrique-2-048-wh-3-000-w","permalink":"https:\/\/www.solandvolt.com\/produit\/ecoflow-delta-3-max-plus-station-electrique-2-048-wh-3-000-w\/","date_created":"2026-10-23T11:43:38","date_created_gmt":"2026-10-23T11:43:38","date_modified":"2026-11-09T11:14:48","date_modified_gmt":"2026-11-09T11:14:48","type":"simple","status":"publish","featured":false,"catalog_visibility":"visible","description":"<h2>L'essentiel<\/h2>\n<p>Station \u00e9lectrique de 2 048 Wh et 3 000 W. M\u00eame capacit\u00e9 que la DELTA 3 Max, avec plus de puissance de sortie et une entr\u00e9e solaire qui accepte jusqu'\u00e0 1 000 W. Elle tient l'essentiel d'une maison pendant une coupure longue.<\/p>\n<h2>Ce qu'elle alimente pendant une coupure<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>R\u00e9frig\u00e9rateur, box internet, \u00e9clairage LED et chargeurs (environ 800 Wh par jour) : de l'ordre de deux jours.<\/li>\n<li>Un r\u00e9frig\u00e9rateur ou un cong\u00e9lateur seul : plusieurs jours, selon le mod\u00e8le.<\/li>\n<li>Des appareils puissants ponctuellement (bouilloire, micro-ondes), dans la limite de 3 000 W.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Caract\u00e9ristiques<\/h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Marque<\/th>\n<td>EcoFlow<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Mod\u00e8le<\/th>\n<td>DELTA 3 Max Plus<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Capacit\u00e9<\/th>\n<td>2 048 Wh<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Puissance de sortie<\/th>\n<td>3 000 W en continu<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recharge solaire<\/th>\n<td>Jusqu'\u00e0 1 000 W<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Poids<\/th>\n<td>Environ 22,1 kg<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<th>R\u00e9f\u00e9rence fabricant<\/th>\n<td>ECF0081<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Poids d'exp\u00e9dition<\/th>\n<td>23,38 kg<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h2>Pour qui<\/h2>\n<p>Niveau 3, La Base. Pour une r\u00e9sidence o\u00f9 une coupure de plusieurs jours ferait perdre le contenu du r\u00e9frig\u00e9rateur, avec assez de panneaux pour la recharger dans la journ\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<h2>Pour aller plus loin<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"\/?p=563\">Panneau solaire EcoFlow 400 W<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"\/categorie-produit\/autonomie-energetique\/la-base\/\">Tous les produits du niveau La Base<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"\/combien-de-wh-batterie-residence-secondaire\/\">Guide : combien de Wh pour une r\u00e9sidence secondaire<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","short_description":"<p>Station EcoFlow 2 048 Wh, 3 000 W. R\u00e9frig\u00e9rateur, box et \u00e9clairage pendant environ deux jours de coupure. Recharge solaire jusqu&#8217;\u00e0 1 000 W.<\/p>\n","sku":"SV-ECF0081","price":"1499","regular_price":"1499","sale_price":"","date_on_sale_from":null,"date_on_sale_from_gmt":null,"date_on_sale_to":null,"date_on_sale_to_gmt":null,"on_sale":false,"purchasable":true,"total_sales":0,"virtual":false,"downloadable":false,"downloads":[],"download_limit":-1,"download_expiry":-1,"external_url":"","button_text":"","tax_status":"taxable","tax_class":"","manage_stock":true,"stock_quantity":14,"backorders":"no","backorders_allowed":false,"backordered":false,"low_stock_amount":null,"sold_individually":false,"weight":"23.38","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"shipping_required":true,"shipping_taxable":true,"shipping_class":"colis-volumineux","shipping_class_id":19,"reviews_allowed":false,"average_rating":"0.00","rating_count":0,"upsell_ids":[],"cross_sell_ids":[],"parent_id":0,"purchase_note":"","categories":[{"id":42,"name":"La Base","slug":"la-base"}],"brands":[{"id":52,"name":"EcoFlow","slug":"ecoflow"}],"tags":[{"id":59,"name":"Niveau 03","slug":"niveau-03"}],"images":[{"id":849,"date_created":"2026-10-23T11:43:35","date_created_gmt":"2026-10-23T11:43:35","date_modified":"2026-10-26T21:02:07","date_modified_gmt":"2026-10-26T21:02:07","src":"https:\/\/www.solandvolt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/ECF0081_66569.jpg","name":"ECF0081_66569.jpg","alt":"Station \u00e9lectrique EcoFlow DELTA 3 Max Plus 2 0